OL,3,GNEWSAFire leads to power outage
OL,4,Aaffecting 2,000 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 2,000 homes were left without
OL,7,Fpower overnight after a large fire at
OL,8,Fan industrial estate.
OL,10,FWest Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsent crews to the site on Wallage Lane
OL,12,Fin Rowfant at around 22:00 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FUK Power Networks said "engineers had
OL,16,Fto unexpectedly turn off the power to
OL,17,F2,190 customers" in an area east of
OL,18,FCrawley in order to isolate an overhead
OL,19,Fcable "for safety".
OL,21,FPower was restored to all the homes by
OL,22,F09:00 on Sunday, the company said.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
